      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    qualified_expenses = 8500\n    magi = 85000\n    filing_status = \"individual\"\n\n    # Calculate the credit before and after the MAGI phase-out\n    eligible_expenses = min(qualified_expenses, 10000)\n    potential_credit = eligible_expenses * 0.20\n    phase_out_factor = (90000 - magi) / (90000 - 80000)\n    credit = potential_credit * phase_out_factor\n\n    # Return the answer to two decimal places\n    return round(credit, 2)\n```",
